  "imoLIVEDoesNotClaim2": "Imo LIVE does not claim end-to-end encryption. Messages travel over TLS to Cloud Firestore and media goes to Cloudflare R2, so those servers can read them. Add a real key-exchange and encryption layer before advertising any encryption guarantee.",
