  "doesImoLIVEHaveEnd": "Does Imo LIVE have end-to-end encryption?",
  "noAndThisAppDeliberately": "No — and this app deliberately does not claim it. Your messages travel over an encrypted connection (TLS) to Cloud Firestore, and media goes to Cloudflare R2, but the servers can read them: end-to-end means only the two participants hold the keys, and no key exchange is implemented yet.",
  "doINeedAnAccount": "Do I need an account or phone number?",
  "anAccountYesSignIn": "An account, yes. Sign in with email, Google or a phone number so your chats and profile can sync and so people can find you. A phone number is just one of the ways someone can look you up, alongside your email, @handle and user id.",
  "whereAreMyPhotosAnd": "Where are my photos and voice notes stored?",
  "aCopyStaysInThe": "A copy stays in the app's private folder on this device, split into images, videos, audio, voice notes, documents, profile photos, wallpapers and status media, and it is uploaded to Cloudflare R2 so the recipient can fetch it. Storage and data shows exactly how much space each category uses and lets you clear any of them.",
  "willMyMessagesDisappear": "Will my messages disappear?",
  "onlyIfYouTurnOn": "Only if you turn on a disappearing-message timer for a chat. Otherwise messages stay until you delete them. The Storage screen has a \"purge expired messages\" action that removes messages whose timer already elapsed.",
  "howDoIMoveMy": "How do I move my chats to a new phone?",
  "signInWithTheSame": "Sign in with the same account on the new phone and your chats are restored from the cloud. Messages sent from either device appear on both, so nothing has to be exported by hand.",
  "whyCanTILink": "Why can't I link a second device?",
  "companionPairingNeedsASession": "Companion pairing needs a session handshake that has not been built yet. The Linked devices screen shows the device you are signed in on and explains what pairing would do, rather than faking a successful link.",
  "canIUseImoLIVE": "Can I use Imo LIVE in my own language?",
  "yesEnglishAndShipWith": "Yes — English and বাংলা ship with complete translations. More languages can be added by dropping a new ARB file into lib/l10n and running the localization generator.",
  "howDoIReportA": "How do I report a problem?",
  "useContactUsBelowReports": "Use \"Contact us\" below. Reports open in your email app so you can see exactly what is being sent.",
